			"chemistry": "The mild acidity of buttermilk tenderises the surface and helps the flour cling. Cornstarch limits gluten and gives a crisper crust.",
			"spiceProfile": "Paprika, cayenne, black pepper and garlic.",
			"variations": "A thick, craggy crust on bone-in pieces fried once. Korean fried chicken is double-fried and glazed, and Japanese karaage uses marinated boneless thighs in a light starch coating."
